<title>MALAYSIA: Mun Loong year net swings to the black.</title>
<headline>Mun Loong year net swings to the black.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  11.10   vs   loss  8.47</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 34.7    vs   loss 26.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   256.97   vs	 289.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    53.67   vs   loss  5.67</p>
<p>    Minorities	  less  39.76   vs   less  1.81</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	   0.39</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Mun Loong Bhd in involved in infrastructure development and construction. It is in the process of disposing its entire equity in retailer Mun Loong-Hankyu Jaya Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
